# Hades: GuC, HuC, GSC and fan control of the xe driver (Lunar Lake, Battlemage, Panther Lake,
# Nova Lake S), which is a module and loads them from the system; xe does not bring a GPU up
# without its GuC. The firmware of i915 and the DMC of the displays of both drivers (i915/) are
# built into the kernel (packages/linux).
